    "updated_at": "2018-02-27T16:45:13Z",
    "body": "This is in principle a normative change, but not one which can reasonably be tested. Any methods used to extract the audio and video (Web Audio API and canvas) wouldn't have timestamps associated with the extracted data to compare, and even if they did that might not match the actual playback experience.\r\n\r\nSo, leaving this without tests or even an issue to test it in the future.",
